                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e88bea9-f8de-3851-8c6f-5f0bc64b8914",
                        "entry_id": "69bbce12-ad23-32fc-9d7a-e899e51e9a72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A chubby, plump, or overweight person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06f261cb-390d-387b-85b0-38d9532b4e34",
                        "entry_id": "69bbce12-ad23-32fc-9d7a-e899e51e9a72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An overweight gay man who is part of the chubby subculture."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "slang",
                            "specifically"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "63879f2a-6533-4618-be7f-c461123f2ebd",
                                "sense_id": "06f261cb-390d-387b-85b0-38d9532b4e34",
                                "text": "It could be any dude, as long as you really want to fuck him. It could be a... a twink, a bear, an otter, a circuit queen, a chub, a pup, a gipster, a daddy chaser, a leatherman, a ladyboy, a Donald Duck. Donald Duck's a gay guy who's been kicked out of the Navy."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4c600b77-4722-3547-b777-5cc476c704c5",
                        "entry_id": "69bbce12-ad23-32fc-9d7a-e899e51e9a72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An erection of the penis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbf212e8-ac15-4cd3-8d89-36bbc22cd100",
                                "sense_id": "4c600b77-4722-3547-b777-5cc476c704c5",
                                "text": "I shift in my seat trying to get comfortable refusing to believe that my dick is in full chub mode right now because of the girl whose pigtails I used to pull to try to drive her crazy when she was younger."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0c29960-5018-41d1-9032-207f90b2c524",
                                "sense_id": "4c600b77-4722-3547-b777-5cc476c704c5",
                                "text": "The DA was a hot young woman who gave me a chub when she finally showed up in a business skirt with a slit in the side, after I had sat around waiting for her for three hours."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7324eaa-15f3-43ab-9a0a-912364e2c513",
                                "sense_id": "4c600b77-4722-3547-b777-5cc476c704c5",
                                "text": "He briefly wondered what Carey might look like naked in his new womanly body, then realized his thoughts were in bad form, thankfully before he had a chance to get an inappropriate chub."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e4697da1-469b-361a-b90e-e778bdb9c6e6",
                        "entry_id": "69bbce12-ad23-32fc-9d7a-e899e51e9a72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A plastic or other flexible package of meat, usually ground meat or luncheon meat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c28de9d-7895-4cac-9958-8a367a1b2f26",
                                "sense_id": "e4697da1-469b-361a-b90e-e778bdb9c6e6",
                                "text": "One thing that makes recovering product harder is grocery stores' and restaurants' practice of regrinding one company's lot, or \"chub,\" of meat with those from other companies, thus making trace-back harder."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7406eba-c902-42d2-ab78-d4f0d36354ac",
                                "sense_id": "e4697da1-469b-361a-b90e-e778bdb9c6e6",
                                "text": "Chub packaging is versatile. Package sizes can range from miniature tubes up to 150-mm diameter and 1220 mm in length (6-in. diameter and 48 in. long). Virtually any pumpable paste can be filled into a chub pack"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c584b509-7ec5-471e-a1ed-8caa60f60de6",
                                "sense_id": "e4697da1-469b-361a-b90e-e778bdb9c6e6",
                                "text": "A typical gelbwurst chub is 24 inches long and about 2V2 inches thick."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c62cdef-4e57-4f93-8e8e-3b5586d248bf",
                                "sense_id": "e4697da1-469b-361a-b90e-e778bdb9c6e6",
                                "text": "Once opened, use or freeze the meat within one day. Tube or chub packaging is used for fresh or frozen ground beef. Use or freeze fresh meat chubs within a day"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf1dcafe-a0e2-4c31-a48f-2afdedbc7cf2",
                                "sense_id": "e4697da1-469b-361a-b90e-e778bdb9c6e6",
                                "text": "A time/temperature history for either the product (4.5 kg chubs of coarse-ground beef) or the storage environment ... After inoculation, the surface of each 4.5-kg coarse-ground beef chub contained six samples inoculated with E. coli"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f441a49-9004-31d8-87be-ee98474ba555",
                        "entry_id": "69bbce12-ad23-32fc-9d7a-e899e51e9a72",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Excess body fat."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8ceeb4a-3e21-48c7-b4f8-90349c6bcb3b",
                                "sense_id": "0f441a49-9004-31d8-87be-ee98474ba555",
                                "text": "so all this chub and lack of fitness will be something I embrace in two days when I quit my new diet and exercise plan."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
